class=\"text-6xl md:text-8xl font-black tracking-tight mb-4 drop-shadow-xl\">\n                Regístrate\n            </h1>\n\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-gray-100\">\n                LA DECISIÓN ESTÁ EN TUS MANOS\n            </h2>\n\n            <p class=\"text-gray-300 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12 leading-relaxed font-light\">\n                Únete a nuestra comunidad global. Tu participación es clave para impulsar el cambio que queremos ver. \n                No dejes pasar la oportunidad de ser parte de algo más grande.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 justify-center items-center w-full\">\n                \n                <button class=\"w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3 bg-transparent border-2 border-white text-white rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition duration-300\">\n                    Iniciar sesión\n                </button>\n\n                <button class=\"w-full md:w-auto px-10 py-4 bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-white rounded-full font-bold text-lg shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/30 transform hover:scale-105 transition duration-300\">\n                    Registro\n                </button>\n\n                <button class=\"w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3 bg-white text-gray-900 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-gray-100 transition duration-300\">\n                    Donaciones\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
